@title Data Reliability Team Charter
@subtitle Osprey Freight, effective 2026-11-01
@author Grace Mbeki, Data Reliability lead

The Data Reliability team is newly formed, led by Grace Mbeki, with 5 engineers.

## Mission

Make every dataset the business relies on trustworthy, on time and explained.

## What we own

- The freshness and quality checks on the 40 tier-1 tables.
- The data incident process.
- The lineage catalog.

## What we do not own

- Dashboards and their business logic. Analytics owns them.
- Source application databases. Product teams own them.
- Ad-hoc data requests.

## How we work

We run two-week sprints. A rotating data on-call covers tier-1 incidents, with a 30 minute response time during business hours. Every incident gets a written review within 5 business days.

## How to reach us

Use the #data-reliability channel, or open a ticket in the DREL queue.

! Requests sent by direct message will be redirected to the DREL queue.
